  "solution": "**Logic : **(Cube of 1st number) ÷ 2 = (2nd number - 1)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• 6 ∶ 109\n\n**(6)³**__ ÷ 2 = __**109 - 1**__\n\n__**216 **____**÷ 2**__ = 108\n\n108 = 108 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd, \n\n__\n \n• 10 ∶ 501\n\n(10)³ ÷ 2 = **501 - 1**__\n\n__**1000 ÷ 2**__ = 500\n\n500 = 500 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n \n• ? ∶ 257\n\n(?)³ ÷ 2 = 257 - 1\n\n(?)³ = 256 × 2\n\n**? = 8**\n\nHence, **\"8\"** is the correct answer. \n\n66:T",
